.TH BIOSEQ.FASTA 4 2000-1月 "open.fingerprint_writer" "open.fingerprint_writer"
.SH NAME
open.fingerprint_writer \- open a fingerprint matrix writer for write the sequence fingerprint data
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIopen.fingerprint_writer(\fBfile\fR as any, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
open a fingerprint matrix writer for write the sequence fingerprint data 
 into a binary BSON file
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBfile\fB \fR\- 
 the output target: a file path of the generated fingerprint matrix file, or 
 a file stream object for write the fingerprint data.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a @\fBT:SMRUCC.genomics.Model.OperonMapper.FingerprintMatrixWriter\fR object for write the sequence 
 fingerprint data into the target file in a stream manner, which can be used 
 by the \fBwrite_fingerprint\fR api;
 
 this function returns a R# error message object if the target file can not 
 be opened for write.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
bioseq.fasta
.SH FILES
.PP
seqtoolkit.dll
.PP
